    "text": "Let the solution curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;of the differential equation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;pass through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
